  data:  # def3
    kind: work_item  # def3
    title: "TS interface-extends-interface emits ZERO inheritance edges (external AND intra-repo)"  # def3
    status: todo_hard  # def3
    priority: 2  # def3
    parent:  # def3
    tags:  # def3
    - analysis_quality  # def3
    isbefore: []  # def3
    duplicate_of: []  # def3
    not_duplicate_of: []  # def3
    pr_ref:  # def3
    description: "Surfaced by an adversarial review of PR #4255 (emission-parity F4 / A2; cross-ref WI-dutov done, WI-jubag).\n\njs_ts.py _extract_inheritance_edges processes only sym.kind=='class' (early 'if sym.kind != \"class\": continue'), and interface symbols are created WITHOUT any base_classes meta (only class_declaration/abstract_class_declaration call _extract_base_classes). Consequently 'interface Child extends Base' produces ZERO inheritance edges whether Base is external or intra-repo.\n\nREPRO (analyzer): 'export interface Base {} ; export interface Child extends Base {}' -> no extends/implements edges; 'import { Observer } from \"rxjs\"; export interface MyObs extends Observer {}' -> no edges (should be 'extends typescript:rxjs:0-0:Observer:unresolved').\n\nCross-language consumer expectation is established: the Java analyzer already extracts interface-extends (java.py ~811) and emits through the shared core inheritance-linker (which accepts kind=='interface').\n\nMINIMAL FIX: (1) extract interface bases into base_classes meta on interface symbols (handle the interface_declaration extends_type_clause, analogous to Java's extends_interfaces). Once interface symbols carry base_classes meta, the shared core inheritance.py linker emits intra-repo edges for free (it already accepts kind=='interface'). (2) the external-orphan case additionally needs js_ts's own A2-style external fallback to cover interfaces (currently gated by kind!='class'). NOTE: TS interfaces use 'extends' (not 'implements') for both class and interface bases, so the extracted bases are extends-bases."  # def3
    fields: {}  # def3
- op: discuss  # c973
  at: '2026-10-01T00:53:00Z'  # c973
  by: agent  # c973
  actor: jgstern_agent  # c973
  clock: 2  # c973
  nonce: c973  # c973
  message: "PREMISE CHECK 2026-09-30 (dev 134a06d505): CURRENT-WITH-UPDATES.\n\nRepro (fixture a.ts: `interface Base`, `interface Child extends Base`, `interface MyObs extends Observer<number>` with Observer imported from \"rxjs\", plus `class K implements Base`; `hypergumbo survey . --out`): the ONLY inheritance edge is K -implements-> Base. Child, MyObs: zero edges; all three interface nodes carry meta.base_classes = None. Premise holds.\n\nCode (no line numbers in the row; relocated by name):\n- js_ts.py:2834 `if sym.kind != \"class\": continue` in _extract_inheritance_edges (def at :2771).\n- js_ts.py:4422 interface_declaration branch builds the Symbol with no meta / no base_classes; _extract_base_classes (:3817) is called only from the class branch (:4384).\n- No commit since 2026-06-21 touched interface_declaration handling (git log -S, 37 commits to js_ts.py since filing, none relevant).\n\nDRIFT the fix must account for:\n1. Fix step (2) is partly superseded. WI-jubag Approach C (70d0cc067e, 2026-07-13, after filing) gave core linkers/inheritance.py an external-base fallback (_external_base_edge, :290) that runs for every kind in type_like_kind_names() (includes \"interface\"). Once interfaces carry base_classes, MyObs gets `typescript:external:0-0:Observer:unresolved` with no js_ts change. The js_ts fallback is still needed ONLY to get the module hint the row asks for (`typescript:rxjs:0-0:Observer:unresolved`).\n2. Edge-type mismatch: core resolve loop (inheritance.py ~:474) tries interface_by_name first and labels any interface target \"implements\". So Child extends Base would come out as Child -implements-> Base, contradicting the row's NOTE that TS interface bases are extends-bases. The fix must emit \"extends\" for interface->interface (in js_ts, or a kind check in core).\n3. Java cross-ref relocated: java.py:1488 (`extends_interfaces`), not ~811.\nNo duplicate or superseding item found (grep of 2462 tracker rows for interface/extend)."  # c973
- op: update  # 1c43
